.TH RGBSEC-DS 1 "2026-08-19" "rgbdns 0.6.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rgbsec-ds \- derive the parent DS record from an rgbdns DNSSEC policy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rgbsec-ds
.I dnssec-line
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads one complete
.B Kzone:keyfile:algorithm:validity:refresh:inception-skew
argument, derives the public DNSKEY, and prints a presentation-format SHA-256
DS record. Publishing that record at the parent activates the chain of trust.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success, 100 for usage errors, and 111 for operational failures.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rgbsec-keygen (1),
.BR rgbsec-check (1),
.BR rgbdns (7)
